[
{
"start": 13.59,
"end": 17.14,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Linear is the incident management platform built for speed \u2013 designed for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 15,
"char_end": 102,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 17.14,
"end": 18.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 103,
"char_end": 124,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 18.0,
"end": 24.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Before we get started, Javier Benavides was on the show discussing how drainage is the design decision with the biggest impact.",
"char_start": 125,
"char_end": 252,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 24.0,
"end": 25.08,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 266,
"char_end": 279,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 25.08,
"end": 30.0,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "And it connects to what we're going to be discussing today.",
"char_start": 280,
"char_end": 339,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 30.0,
"end": 36.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "I want to point out something \u2013 Javier Benavides mentioned this same dynamic a couple of episodes ago.",
"char_start": 355,
"char_end": 457,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 36.0,
"end": 38.1,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Tell me a specific example.",
"char_start": 458,
"char_end": 485,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 38.1,
"end": 42.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 486,
"char_end": 536,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 42.0,
"end": 44.57,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Honestly, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 550,
"char_end": 642,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 44.57,
"end": 46.07,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox components.",
"char_start": 643,
"char_end": 697,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 46.07,
"end": 48.0,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 698,
"char_end": 767,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 48.0,
"end": 50.39,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 783,
"char_end": 816,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 50.39,
"end": 54.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 817,
"char_end": 867,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 54.0,
"end": 54.17,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Sure.",
"char_start": 881,
"char_end": 886,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 54.17,
"end": 57.67,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing are usually more important than minor suspension adjustments.",
"char_start": 887,
"char_end": 992,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 57.67,
"end": 60.0,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 993,
"char_end": 1063,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 60.0,
"end": 61.59,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1079,
"char_end": 1097,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 61.59,
"end": 66.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1098,
"char_end": 1148,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 66.0,
"end": 69.02,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in cycling isn't about avoiding crashes altogether; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1162,
"char_end": 1289,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 69.02,
"end": 70.24,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "We've seen it in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 1290,
"char_end": 1341,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 70.24,
"end": 72.0,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1342,
"char_end": 1416,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 72.0,
"end": 78.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where does that stop working?",
"char_start": 1432,
"char_end": 1461,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 78.0,
"end": 81.1,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1475,
"char_end": 1551,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 81.1,
"end": 84.0,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1552,
"char_end": 1623,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 84.0,
"end": 87.09,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always fall back on?",
"char_start": 1639,
"char_end": 1690,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 87.09,
"end": 90.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this landscape?",
"char_start": 1691,
"char_end": 1739,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 90.0,
"end": 90.57,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1753,
"char_end": 1773,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 90.57,
"end": 94.13,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the track sections change the choice of racing line between practice sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 1774,
"char_end": 1900,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 120.0,
"end": 122.25,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1916,
"char_end": 1949,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 122.25,
"end": 126.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What is the version of the question that truly matters?",
"char_start": 1950,
"char_end": 2005,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 126.0,
"end": 127.27,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 2019,
"char_end": 2071,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 127.27,
"end": 129.28,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 2072,
"char_end": 2154,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 129.28,
"end": 130.33,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 2155,
"char_end": 2198,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 130.33,
"end": 132.0,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 2199,
"char_end": 2267,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 132.0,
"end": 134.07,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 2283,
"char_end": 2320,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 134.07,
"end": 138.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What is the operating angle that most listeners do not have access to?",
"char_start": 2321,
"char_end": 2391,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 138.0,
"end": 141.65,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "Yes, look \u2013 tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a minor suspension adjustment.",
"char_start": 2405,
"char_end": 2514,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 141.65,
"end": 144.0,
"speaker_label": "Marta Sol\u00eds",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 2515,
"char_end": 2585,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 144.0,
"end": 145.98,
